<releaseinfo>1.1.0</releaseinfo>

<abstract>
<para>
&valverush; is a fast-paced logic puzzle game for KDE inspired by the classic
Pipe Mania. Place pipes on the board before the pressurized valve opens and
the fluid leaks!
</para>
</abstract>

<keywordset>
<keyword>KDE</keyword>
<keyword>kdegames</keyword>
<keyword>game</keyword>
<keyword>ValveRush</keyword>
<keyword>Pipe Mania</keyword>
<keyword>puzzle</keyword>
<keyword>logic</keyword>
</keywordset>
</bookinfo>

<chapter id="introduction">
<title>Introduction</title>
<para>
&valverush; challenges you to build a continuous pipeline from a pressurized
start valve before the fluid reaches an open end and leaks onto the floor.
</para>
<para>
Each level starts with a brief countdown while the valve remains closed, giving
you time to lay out the initial pipes. Once the valve opens, fluid advances
steadily through connected segments. Reach the target pipe count for the level
before a leak occurs to advance to the next stage!
</para>
</chapter>

<chapter id="howto">
<title>How to Play</title>
<para>
The game board is a 10×7 grid containing a <guilabel>Start Valve</guilabel>
(marked in amber with an outlet direction) and, on higher levels or harder
difficulties, solid obstacle blocks.
</para>
<itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>
The <guilabel>Next Pipes</guilabel> panel on the right displays the next 5
pipe pieces in your queue. The highlighted piece at the top is the next one
you will place.
</para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>
Click any empty cell (or navigate with the arrow keys and press
<keycap>Enter</keycap> or <keycap>Space</keycap>) to place the active pipe.
</para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>
You may replace an existing pipe that has not yet been filled with fluid by
clicking it again, at the cost of a small score penalty (-50 points).
</para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>
Once your pipeline is long enough, activate <guibutton>Fast Flow</guibutton>
(shortcut <keycap>F</keycap>) to accelerate the fluid and earn bonus points
for every segment traversed in fast-forward mode.
</para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</chapter>

<chapter id="rules_and_tips">
<title>Rules, Scoring, and Tips</title>
<sect1 id="scoring">
<title>Scoring</title>
<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><emphasis>Standard pipe filled:</emphasis> +100 points</para></listitem>
<listitem><para><emphasis>Extra pipe beyond level target:</emphasis> +200 additional points</para></listitem>
<listitem><para><emphasis>Cross pipe double traversal:</emphasis> +500 bonus points when fluid passes through both perpendicular channels of a cross pipe</para></listitem>
<listitem><para><emphasis>Fast Flow bonus:</emphasis> +50 points per pipe filled while Fast Flow is active</para></listitem>
<listitem><para><emphasis>Replacing a pipe:</emphasis> -50 points</para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="tips">
<title>Strategy Tips</title>
<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Use the initial countdown to build a clean path away from the start valve's outlet.</para></listitem>
<listitem><para>Save cross pipes for loops so you can cross the same tile twice for the +500 bonus.</para></listitem>
<listitem><para>Use narrow (restrictor) horizontal and vertical pipes strategically to slow down the fluid and buy extra time to build ahead.</para></listitem>
<listitem><para>Don't trigger <guibutton>Fast Flow</guibutton> until you are sure your pipeline meets the level target.</para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</sect1>
</chapter>

<chapter id="interface">
<title>Interface Overview</title>
<sect1 id="menus">
<title>Menu Items</title>
<variablelist>
<varlistentry>
<term><menuchoice>
<shortcut><keycombo action="simul">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut>
<guimenu>Game</guimenu>
<guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>
</menuchoice></term>
<listitem><para>Starts a new game from Level 1.</para></listitem>
</varlistentry>

<varlistentry>
<term><menuchoice>
<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut>
<guimenu>Game</guimenu>
<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>
</menuchoice></term>
<listitem><para>Pauses or resumes the countdown and fluid flow.</para></listitem>
</varlistentry>

<varlistentry>
<term><menuchoice>
<shortcut><keycap>F</keycap></shortcut>
<guimenu>Game</guimenu>
<guimenuitem>Fast Forward Flow</guimenuitem>
</menuchoice></term>
<listitem><para>Accelerates fluid movement for bonus points.</para></listitem>
</varlistentry>

<varlistentry>
<term><menuchoice>
<shortcut><keycombo action="simul">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut>
<guimenu>Game</guimenu>
<guimenuitem>Show High Scores</guimenuitem>
</menuchoice></term>
<listitem><para>Displays the local high score table per difficulty level.</para></listitem>
</varlistentry>

<varlistentry>
<term><menuchoice>
<guimenu>Settings</guimenu>
<guimenuitem>Configure Theme...</guimenuitem>
</menuchoice></term>
<listitem><para>Choose between Breeze Industrial, Neon Pipeline, and Classic Symbian visual themes.</para></listitem>
</varlistentry>
</variablelist>
</sect1>
</chapter>

